--- Page 2 ---
PROBLEM STATEMENT :
Create an AI-powered Autonomous Network Intelligence & Security Assessment System (ANISAS) that 
uses a single public IP address as input to automatically identify, evaluate, and display an authorized 
network's security posture via an intelligent risk assessment and interactive dashboard.
IMPORTANCE :
•
Increasing cyber threats
•
Faster risk identification
•
Improved security decision-making


