--- Page 4 ---
PROPOSED SOLUTION 
OVERVIEW :
•
Accepts a public IP as input.
•
Collects data from Nmap, Shodan, AbuseIPDB and NVD
•
Performs AI-based risk analysis
•
Generates interactive dashboard and reports.
•
Provides security recommendations.


